&lt;p&gt;Our engineers and consultants collaborate to solve complex safety and security challenges, ensuring our clients can protect what matters most. For over 80 years, we have helped mitigate risks that threaten lives, property and reputations. Through technology, expertise and industry-leading research, we remain dedicated to our purpose of making our world safe, secure and resilient.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Jensen Hughes, we believe that creating and sustaining a culture of trust, integrity and professional growth starts with putting our people first. Our employees are our greatest strength, and we value the unique perspectives and talents they bring to our organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our wide range of Global Employee Networks connect people from across the organization, supporting career development and providing forums for individuals to share experiences on topics they’re passionate about. Together, we are cultivating a connected culture where everyone has the opportunity to learn, grow and succeed together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Jensen Hughes are seeking an experienced and commercially minded Principal Fire Engineer to join our growing team in Manchester. This is a technical leadership role offering the opportunity to deliver complex fire engineering projects across a diverse portfolio of sectors including commercial, residential, healthcare, education, industrial, and infrastructure developments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Principal Fire Engineer, you will play a key role in shaping fire safety strategies, ensuring regulatory compliance, and supporting business growth through strong client relationships and technical innovation. You will not only lead on some of the industry’s most exciting projects but also have a key role in shaping the future talent within our teams through mentorship and development opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join us to grow your career?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are the largest fire consultancy in Europe with offices located in Belgium, Finland, Denmark, Italy, and the UK &amp;amp; Ireland. Our reputation for providing innovative, design-focused solutions has made us the consultant of choice for many of Europe’s leading property clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As a Principal Engineer you will be an integral part of a dynamic technical team, working with other experienced Engineers, Surveyors and teams including our Forensics division. You will work on the industry&#39;s leading technical projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with us offers an exciting range of opportunities to develop your career within a supportive and diverse team that always strives to do the right thing for our people, clients and communities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will be given early the opportunity to progress rapidly. Jensen Hughes encourages all Engineers to achieve chartered status and offer help and support during the process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and deliver complex fire engineering projects from inception through to completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop fire strategies for a wide range of new-build and existing building projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Undertake fire safety engineering analyses, including evacuation modelling, smoke control assessments, and performance-based design solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide expert advice on compliance with UK Building Regulations, Approved Document B, and relevant fire safety legislation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review and approve technical reports, calculations, and design documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaise with architects, developers, contractors, approval authorities, and wider project teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a technical lead and mentor for junior and mid-level engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to business development activities, including client engagement, tender submissions, and project proposals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain awareness of evolving legislation, industry standards, and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the business at client meetings, industry events, and technical forums.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements and Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree qualified in Fire Engineering, Mechanical Engineering or related engineering discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideally be or working towards becoming a Chartered Engineer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A background in fire engineering preferably within a consultancy environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and annual bonus scheme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid and flexible working arrangements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private healthcare.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous pension contribution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life assurance and income protection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional membership subscriptions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ongoing training and support towards professional development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear career progression pathways.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative and inclusive working environment where technical excellence is valued and rewarded.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;#LI-SG1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Jensen Hughes is an Equal Opportunity Employer. Qualified candidates will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, gender identity, disability or protected veteran status.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Jensen Hughes, we embrace innovation and understand that people are increasingly using artificial intelligence (AI) tools like ChatGPT and other generative platforms to learn, prepare and communicate.&amp;nbsp; We have provided some guidelines regarding the responsible use of AI in the recruitment process.&amp;nbsp; Please click &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.jensenhughes.com/careers/responsible-use-of-ai-in-the-jensen-hughes-recruitment-process&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; to review.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;The security of your personal data is important to us. Jensen Hughes has implemented reasonable physical, technical, and administrative security standards to protect personal data from loss, misuse, alteration, or destruction. We protect your personal data against unauthorized access, use, or disclosure, using security technologies and procedures, such as encryption and limited access. Only authorized individuals may access your personal data for the purpose for which it was collected, and these individuals receive training about the importance of protecting personal data.&amp;nbsp; Jensen Hughes is committed to compliance with all relevant data privacy laws in all areas where we do business, including, but not limited to, the GDPR and the CCPA.&amp;nbsp; Additionally, our service providers are contractually bound to maintain the confidentiality of personal data and may not use the information for any unauthorized purpose.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*Policy on use of 3rd party recruiting agency for direct placements&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Jensen Hughes will occasionally augment a recruiting search through agencies for certain positions when business conditions warrant. Jensen Hughes will not accept resumes, inquiries or proposals from recruiting agencies as an acceptable method to consider a candidate. 3rd party recruiting agencies must sign a standard Jensen Hughes agreement after being evaluated and accepted by a Human Resources or Talent Acquisition manager, or member of the talent acquisition team. Hiring managers and employees of Jensen Hughes are not authorized to accept resumes, engage in fee-based searches through recruiting firms or sign a search agreement. Please note this policy does not apply to “staffing firms” or firms that are involved with hiring temporary staff. Any recruiting agency interested in being considered may contact our recruiting team at jensenhughesrecruiting.com.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3176 - VP, Data Strategy, UK - UK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an VP, Data Strategy to work on a client portfolio across Wavemaker &amp;amp; T&amp;amp;P UK. This individual will play a pivotal role in defining the role of data in our clients&#39; businesses and driving the adoption of Open Intelligence, InfoSum and the Open Media Studio (OMS) Platform across Wavemaker &amp;amp; T&amp;amp;P UK clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will accelerate the use of data to inform brilliant advertising strategies, managing client satisfaction, commercial health, and their understanding of our platform, solutions, and consulting services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will support business growth through leading data strategy on key new business opportunities and driving organic growth from existing clients. This will be achieved by developing data strategies, evangelising our platform and capabilities, and providing thought leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This dynamic leader will shape our success by being accountable for achieving full penetration of the OMS Platform and Open Intelligence within all clients in their portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive Senior Client Partnership: act as the senior data strategy partner for your portfolio of clients, engaging with key leaders responsible for data and technology. You will translate their business needs &amp;amp; objectives into innovative data strategies and ensure our solutions deliver a measurable competitive advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spearhead Platform Innovation: go beyond adoption to drive the evolution of our platforms including innovative new use cases. You will lead the charge on ensuring innovative application of platforms like Open Intelligence and InfoSum, shaping the use of Agentic AI, and ensuring the highest standards of data governance and ethics are upheld.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead Data Strategy Capability: You will set the foundations for smart, audience-led, and analytically driven media plans that deliver client outcomes. You will be responsible for overseeing and developing the Data Strategy talent across your portfolio of clients and assembling the right teams and capabilities to help our clients succeed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial and Revenue Management: You will partner with the UK Commercial teams to design proposals that deliver value and are competitive. The profitability of work delivered by the data strategy team within your client portfolio across Wavemaker &amp;amp; T&amp;amp;P will be your responsibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thought Leadership: You will stay at the forefront of industry trends and technologies, providing thought leadership that sets WPP Media apart.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At WPP Media, we believe in the power of our culture and our people. It’s what elevates us to deliver exceptional experiences for both our clients and each other. In this role it will be critical to embrace WPP &amp;amp; WPP Media’s shared core values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be Extraordinary by Leading Collectively to Inspire transformational Creativity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create an Open environment by Balancing People and Client Experiences by Cultivating Trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead Optimistically by Championing Growth and Development to Mobilize the Enterprise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What you’ll need&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven Leadership: Demonstrated experience in a leadership role within agency, Adtech, Advertising, or a closely related field, with a track record of successful outcomes in a matrixed organisational structure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Expertise: A deep understanding of data products, technology, and trends within the advertising and marketing industry, with the ability to articulate complex technical concepts to both technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consultative Selling: Proficiency in consultative selling, with the ability to understand client needs, articulate the value proposition of our platform, and tailor solutions to meet those needs effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer Focus: A relentless focus on customer success, with a passion for delivering exceptional client experiences and driving long-term relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business Acumen: A history of driving revenue and achieving high levels of client satisfaction through strategic decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Change Management: The ability to navigate and drive organisational change, guiding stakeholders through the adoption process and overcoming resistance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication Skills: Exceptional communication and relationship-building skills, as this role hinges on effective interaction with clients and agency stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic Vision: A strategic mindset that enables you to create a data strategy and vision that delivers growth for our clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bonus points&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in or with clients in the automotive, FMCG or government sectors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working within large marketing agencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the WPP Media or WPP ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Who you are&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic Thinker: You have a strategic mindset and the capability to drive revenue growth and client satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Visionary Leader: You are a visionary leader with a deep understanding of data products and technology, able to guide your team and clients into the future.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relationship Builder: You possess the ability to effectively engage with clients and key agency stakeholders, nurturing relationships that drive success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thought Leader: You are an industry thought leader, actively contributing to the advancement of data-driven marketing and advertising technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate Advocate: You are passionate about leveraging data to create unbeatable advantages for our clients while building trust and understanding with their customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to&amp;nbsp;Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also&amp;nbsp;Lead Optimistically,&amp;nbsp;firmly believing&amp;nbsp;in and&amp;nbsp;Championing Growth and Development&amp;nbsp;for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to&amp;nbsp;leverage&amp;nbsp;the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the&amp;nbsp;cutting edge&amp;nbsp;of marketing and advertising.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&amp;nbsp;Create an Open environment&amp;nbsp;built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events&amp;nbsp;showcasing&amp;nbsp;team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment.&amp;nbsp;That&#39;s&amp;nbsp;why&amp;nbsp;we’ve&amp;nbsp;adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you&amp;nbsp;require&amp;nbsp;accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&amp;nbsp; Please note that while our philosophy is the same across WPP, benefits may vary by office/country.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy)&lt;/a&gt; for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
